<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>배송 현황</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: sans-serif; padding: 20px; }
        h1 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
        th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
        tr:nth-child(even) { background-color: #f9f9f9; }
        .error { color: red; margin: 8px 0; }
        .hint { color: #6c757d; font-size: 0.9em; margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .btn { padding: 6px 14px; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 0.9em; }
        .btn-success { background-color: #28a745; color: white; }
        .status-badge { padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; }
        .status-ASSIGNED  { background: #cfe2ff; color: #084298; }
        .status-APPROVED  { background: #d1e7dd; color: #0a3622; }
        .status-PICKING   { background: #fff3cd; color: #664d03; }
        .status-PACKING   { background: #fff3cd; color: #664d03; }
        .status-SHIPPED   { background: #f0d9ff; color: #4a0072; }
        .status-DELIVERED { background: #d1e7dd; color: #0a3622; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>배송 현황</h1>
<p class="hint">배송이 도착하면 "수령 완료" 버튼을 눌러주세요. 발주 내역의 상태가 자동으로 업데이트됩니다.</p>

{{#errorMessage}}
    <p class="error">{{errorMessage}}</p>
{{/errorMessage}}

<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>출고 ID</th>
            <th>출발 창고</th>
            <th>발주 요청 시간</th>
            <th>품목</th>
            <th>배송 상태</th>
            <th>수령 확인</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        {{#deliveries}}
        <tr>
            <td>{{id}}</td>
            <td>{{warehouseName}}</td>
            <td>{{requestTime}}</td>
            <td><a href="/delivery/{{id}}">{{detailCount}}종 보기</a></td>
            <td>
                <span class="status-badge status-{{statusCode}}">{{statusDescription}}</span>
            </td>
            <td>
                {{#canDeliver}}
                <form action="/delivery/{{id}}/complete" method="post" style="display:inline;">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-success"
                            onclick="return confirm('상품을 수령하셨습니까? 배송 완료로 처리됩니다.')">수령 완료</button>
                </form>
                {{/canDeliver}}
                {{^canDeliver}}
                <span style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 0.9em;">—</span>
                {{/canDeliver}}
            </td>
        </tr>
        {{/deliveries}}
        {{^deliveries}}
        <tr>
            <td colspan="6" style="text-align: center;">배송 내역이 없습니다.</td>
        </tr>
        {{/deliveries}}
    </tbody>
</table>

</body>
</html>
